Keep the vendored OpenThread tree byte-identical to its pinned archives when
committed to the 5BSD repository.  OpenThread's DartConfiguration.tcl ignore
pattern also matched Mbed TLS's tracked copy, and OpenThread's text=auto
attribute (written for a tree where Mbed TLS is a submodule) would rewrite
CRLF sources and binary test data in the vendored Mbed TLS subtree.
--- a/openthread/.gitignore
+++ b/openthread/.gitignore
@@ -57,5 +57,5 @@
 tests/nexus/nexus_*
 
 # Misc
-DartConfiguration.tcl
+/DartConfiguration.tcl
 third_party/mbedtls/openthread-mbedtls-config.h
--- a/openthread/third_party/mbedtls/repo/.gitattributes
+++ b/openthread/third_party/mbedtls/repo/.gitattributes
@@ -1,2 +1,4 @@
 # Classify all '.function' files as C for syntax highlighting purposes
 *.function linguist-language=C
+# 5BSD: vendored verbatim; no end-of-line conversion.
+* -text
